  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering IPLC&apos;s in Guyana to combat deforestation caused by mining</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is that indigneaous and local communities, and the wider Guyaneses society, enjoy ecosystem services and related human wellbeing benefits provided through reduced deforestation and land degradation from the risk of mining. The main partner is the National Toushaos Council (NTC).</narrative>
  </description>
